# Quarto build artefacts
quarto/_book/
quarto/.quarto/
quarto/site_libs/
quarto/index.typ                 # generated Typst (from keep-typ); source is index.qmd
quarto/*_files/                  # generated per-doc figure dirs (Mermaid PNGs, etc.)

# Generated chapter pages — produced from book/*.md by the pre-render hook.
# index.qmd is hand-authored and kept; the rest are ephemeral.
quarto/*.qmd
!quarto/index.qmd

# Oversized research PDFs (image-heavy, 36–39 MB each) — the dossiers capture
# their findings and `fetch_arxiv.py <id>` re-downloads them on demand, so we
# don't vendor them into git history. See the note in each dossier.
research/papers/pdf/2411.19537.pdf
research/papers/pdf/2506.08872.pdf

# OS / editor cruft
.DS_Store
